WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.087
Let’s walk through Proposals.

00:00:02.087 --> 00:00:06.525
Read the proposal and the complete recipient-specific thread before responding

00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:06.650
.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.988
The first decision opens an isolated negotiation record;

00:00:09.988 --> 00:00:13.275
later rounds must remain attached to that same thread.

00:00:13.275 --> 00:00:16.062
On this slide, read proposals White Cell forwarded to

00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:19.837
this recipient and manage the append-only response thread.

00:00:19.837 --> 00:00:23.400
In practice, accept, Not Interested, or Negotiate

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.812
starts the recipient’s isolated thread;

00:00:25.812 --> 00:00:27.938
later rounds stay attached to it.

00:00:28.435 --> 00:00:31.297
When you are ready, use Open proposals in Team

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:34.222
Action Review to move to the live surface.

00:00:34.222 --> 00:00:36.960
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.110
.
